<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2071" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθῡμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fainthearted,
			spiritless</i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκελέες καὶ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.463
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸς καὶ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ τοῖς ἀ. ἡ τύχη ξυλλαμβάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					927
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OT</u>
				319
			</span></i>; of nations, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθυμος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1327b28
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					405.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εἶναι πρός τι</span> to
			have <i>little heart</i> for it, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.4.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύμως, ἔχειν πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.5.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύμως διάγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύμως πονεῖν</span> to work
				<i>without spirit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				21.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοὺς ἀ. τιθέντες</span>
			<i>discouraging</i> their marches, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				770
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without anger</i> or <i>passion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				411b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				888a
			</span></i>.</div>
